  "content": "<h1>Cobblemon 知識寶典</h1><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-knowlogy/files/all?gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://vinnystalck.gitlab.io/minecraft-badges/badges/fabric/compact-supports.svg\" alt=\"支援 Fabric\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-knowlogy/files/all?gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://vinnystalck.gitlab.io/minecraft-badges/badges/neoforge/compact-supports.svg\" alt=\"支援 NeoForge\"></a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcobblemon-knowlogy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/dba1h0rW?style=flat&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;label=下載次數&amp;labelColor=03190a&amp;color=1e1e1e\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載量\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon-knowlogy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1144644?style=flat&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;label=下載次數&amp;labelColor=241009&amp;color=1e1e1e\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載量\"></a></p><p>這是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knowlogy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">知識寶典</a>的擴充模組，可將<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblemon</a>的資訊加入<strong>知識寶典之書</strong>，顯示來自<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.cobblemon.com%252findex.php%252fMain_Page\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方 Cobblemon 維基</a>的資料。</p><p>本模組旨在延續我之前開發的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblepedia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobblepedia</a>模組。</p><h2>依賴項目</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knowlogy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://vinnystalck.gitlab.io/minecraft-badges/badges/knowlogy/compact-requires.svg\" alt=\"知識寶典之書\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobblemon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://vinnystalck.gitlab.io/minecraft-badges/badges/cobblemon/compact-requires.svg\" alt=\"Cobblemon\"></a></p><p>以及所有相關的必要條件。</p><h2>功能特色</h2><h3>自訂元件</h3><p>透過自訂元件更直觀地顯示寶可夢掉落物、樹果突變與化石復活機制。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/dba1h0rW/images/70f4a1c8dab2a96e3840a27c1027b3ce9cf5b937.png\" alt=\"寶可夢掉落物\"></p><h3>寶可夢百科資源包</h3><p>使用模組內含的選用資源包，可將<strong>知識寶典之書</strong>轉換為<strong>寶可夢百科</strong>，物品與介面材質均以寶可夢圖鑑為設計基礎。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/dba1h0rW/images/d30b21ef31db50d8e3e564a15befafa670659273.png\" alt=\"寶可夢百科資源包\"></p><h2>協助專案發展</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fM4M5K4BDR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://badges.penpow.dev/badges/donate/kofi-singular/cozy.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi 贊助\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fknowlogy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://badges.penpow.dev/badges/translate/crowdin/cozy.svg\" alt=\"Crowdin 翻譯\"></a></p>\n\n（注：保留所有原始链接与图片路径不变，仅对可见文本进行繁体中文本地化翻译，采用台湾常用游戏术语如「宝可梦」「模组」「资源包」等，并保持HTML标签结构完整）",
